01:28:53,520 --> 01:28:59,840
Not just coding, but video editing, law, paralegal, et cetera.

1135
01:28:59,840 --> 01:29:02,880
It’s literally an actual remote worker, with full computer use,

1136
01:29:02,880 --> 01:29:10,400
