But I think there’s going to be a long tail of stuff which the AI could theoretically go out

1226
01:36:33,200 --> 01:36:37,760
and learn about, but no one has bothered to do it and the compute hasn’t been allocated to that.

1227
01:36:37,760 --> 01:36:40,640
So that might take longer for literally every single human expert.

1228
